# SBF blocks of the group SBF_GNSS_ATTITUDE_BLOCKS of pysbf2, one kind per block of fixed length.
# Generated by tools/gen/sbf2pack.py; do not edit by hand.
# The message is one SBF block without its sync characters and CRC: block ID
# (u16), length (u16), body. Body bit 0 is bit 32.
format        sbf-gnss-attitude
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "https://github.com/semuconsulting/pysbf2 src/pysbf2/sbftypes_blocks.py at v1.0.7 (commit 38eb890ddfae29f55a8cdfe4029033e2077767fc)"
